{"v":4,"catch":"Jewel Match Solitaire 是終極放鬆的紙牌遊戲！","desc":"在這個美麗的新紙牌冒險中回到 Jewel Match 的世界！\n穿越古老的土地，重建古老的史詩城堡。\n總共超過 320 個級別，還有許多紙牌變體，包括 Klondike、Spider、Freecell、Pyramid 等等！\n數十種獨特的遊戲替代方案通過鎖定和凍結的紙牌、需要移除的障礙物（如藤蔓和蠟封）改變您的經典紙牌遊戲，\n以及外卡、百搭牌和洗牌等道具。 在每個級別搜索寶石和硬幣，以購買新的城堡升級和能量提升。\nJewel Match Solitaire 是終極放鬆的紙牌遊戲！\n\n- 掌握 18 種額外的紙牌變體\n- 建造 8 座美麗的城堡！\n- 可獲得數十個獎杯。\n- 內置策略指南\n- 從幾個卡片組中選擇。","publisher":"Ocean Media","release":"2023-01-26","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85f86259b982ff92155eef6d7c96de1de8a6cc7e173d5406d6f6e5f36c47a902.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d4865b983fb7cf296f1ccc82cab7232094a22db06ee2735afeace604485f0d1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a1f057d440b321fe22255832c2367aa14940556f3be7acbac78ca188e93bc318.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c187b2a2e51eaee884db2aaf5a2c00027f07a380dcb0e0eff36d0d30fea60056.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8db62fba02ed99e0614af7e5221f40a9a9f03de293f2d2dd40d238b366371813.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae2eb0115fe6f251b568d6e9be98b0edcb7929fbf93d01e3bfd2a5e6174f298e.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a5201a46e000","dlc":[]}